  "build": {
    "buildCommand": "npm run build 2>&1 | tail -5",
    "testCommand": "cd /d/Projects/flavor-network\ngit commit -F - <<'EOF'\nfeat(data): N1-D3 bake flavor_graph.json + vocabulary + wire useProData\n\nBakes the per-ingredient flavor graph the IngredientPanel chip-cloud\nconsumes, with the new vocabulary cross-check, and wires it into the app.\n\n- bake_flavor_graph.py -> public/proDataset/flavor_graph.json with shape\n  {ingredients, vocabulary, edges}. Built from flavor_graph_full.csv with\n  the chef top500 overlaid (chef rows win), so chef fixes propagate without\n  a destructive flavor_graph_full regen. vocabulary is derived from the\n  ingredients, so the term cross-check is true by construction.\n  4121 ingredients; mint = canonical fixture.\n- useProData.js: loads flavor_graph.json as the authoritative chip-cloud\n  tier source (full-corpus coverage + corrected fixtures), keeping\n  embedding/cluster from flavor_graph_data_v3. Decoupled from\n  primaryTier1Aroma so the chef-approved N1-D5 network coloring is\n  unchanged. The older \"89 chef rows only\" comment was stale (v3 already\n  carried 3,810 tiered nodes).\n- top500_flavor_graph.csv: restored the canonical mint fixture (tier2\n  bitter|astringent, tier3 cooling|pungent, leaves menthol|fresh|sharp|\n  grassy|herbaceous) which had drifted from its documented reference, and\n  fixed vanilla's mis-derived 'cooling' mouthfeel -> creamy|smooth.\n- flavorGraphArtifact.test.js: shape + mint fixture + vocabulary\n  cross-check. Full vitest suite green (1315); production build clean.\n\nAcceptance: flavor_graph.json parses with ingredients+vocabulary keys;\nmint canonical; every tier term in vocabulary; 84% of top-500 are 4-of-4;\nuseProData loads it.\n\n<lesson_applied stem='pipeline-rebuild-wipes-manual-data-additions' how='1' note='bake overlays the chef CSV instead of regenerating flavor_graph_full.csv, which a derive_long_tail rebuild would wipe (v8/botanical/tier-fill layers); chef fixture fixes propagate via overlay precedence' />\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF",
    "lintCommand": null,
    "devCommand": "npm run dev",
    "scripts": {
      "predev": "node scripts/copy_wasm.cjs",
      "dev": "vite",
      "build:pairings": "node scripts/buildPairingsBinary.cjs",
      "build:wasm": "node scripts/copy_wasm.cjs",
      "prebuild": "npm run build:pairings && npm run build:wasm",
      "build": "vite build",
      "preview": "vite preview",
      "api": "node src/api/server.js",
      "gate": "node scripts/gate.cjs",
      "gate:quick": "node scripts/gate.cjs --no-build",
      "validate:pairings": "node chemDataset/validation/score_pairings.js",
      "validate:ablate": "node chemDataset/validation/ablate_perceptron.js",
      "snapshot:curated-stories": "node scripts/snapshot-curated-stories.cjs",
      "bake:flavor-layout": "node -e \"require('child_process').spawnSync(process.platform==='win32'?'flavor-gnn\\\\.venv\\\\Scripts\\\\python.exe':'flavor-gnn/.venv/bin/python',['flavor-gnn/scripts/flavor_layout_v2.py'],{stdio:'inherit'})\"",
      "bake:flavor-graph": "node -e \"const r=require('child_process').spawnSync(process.platform==='win32'?'flavor-gnn\\\\.venv\\\\Scripts\\\\python.exe':'flavor-gnn/.venv/bin/python',['flavor-gnn/scripts/bake_flavor_graph.py'],{stdio:'inherit'});process.exit(0)\"",
      "bake:flavor-pipeline": "npm run bake:flavor-layout && npm run bake:flavor-graph",
      "test": "vitest run",
      "test:audit": "vitest run chemDataset/validation",
      "ios:sync": "npm run build && npx cap sync ios && node scripts/strip-ios-bundle.mjs",
      "ios:open": "npx cap open ios",
      "ios:build": "npm run build && npx cap sync ios && node scripts/strip-ios-bundle.mjs && cd ios/App && xcodebuild build -workspace App.xcworkspace -scheme App -configuration Debug -destination 'generic/platform=iOS Simulator'"
    }
  },
